  "router_policy": {
    "version": "stage3_skill_router_rules_v0",
    "strategy_zh": "第一版使用规则路由器，不使用 LLM 或 VLA。路由器只选择技能，不直接输出 actuator。",
    "thresholds": {
      "min_vision_confidence_for_action": 0.55,
      "min_vision_confidence_for_reacquire": 0.35,
      "max_pose_error_for_pinch_m": 0.015,
      "slip_recovery_threshold": 0.3,
      "crush_abort_threshold": 0.35,
      "penetration_abort_threshold_m": 0.004
    },
    "ordered_rules_zh": [
      "如果触觉显示已经接触且滑移高，优先选择 slip_recovery。",
      "如果视觉置信度太低且还没有接触，先选择 acquire_vision_pose。",
      "如果任务希望捏持、空间清晰、视觉置信度和位姿误差达标，选择 thumb_index_middle_pinch。",
      "如果可见性低、空间拥挤、用户强调 gentle，选择 full_hand_gentle_grasp。",
      "如果安全指标超阈值，选择 release_or_abort。"
    ]
  },
